Subject: [PATCH] fix(post): declare indexed offsets for grblHAL and TinyG

Use the validated offset index and state the six supported work offsets.
Add both scripts to the existing offset contract tests.

Co-Authored-By: Codex <noreply@openai.com>

Fixes #1385
